{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41170","headline":"将窜留诗 · 捧劒仆","name":"将窜留诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍重郭四郎，临行不得别。\n晓漏动离心，轻车冒残雪。\n欲出主人门，零涕暗呜咽。\n万里隔关山，一心思汉月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"捧劒仆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}